# The public repo holds ONLY what the live site needs: index.html, assets, README,
# and the worker README. Everything else is authoring, testing or local scratch.
#
# NOTE (2026-08-24): this file is edited ON THE DEVICE. A session that edits its own
# container copy will be working from a stale version and will silently drop lines.
# Stage this file first, or edit it here.

# Local-only dev and authoring files
CLAUDE.md
SPEC.md
build_bank.py
splice.py
template.html
collide.py
verify.py
serve.ps1

# Test suites. Pattern rather than a list of names, because naming them one by
# one meant storetest.py got committed the moment it was written (2026-08-25).
# worker/test.mjs is .mjs and stays tracked: it is part of the worker.
*test*.py
smoke.py

# One-off patch scripts
fix_engine.py
fix2.py
fix3.py
fix4.py
fix5.py
fix6.py
fix7.py

# Generated intermediates and reports
dev/
content/
docs/
shot-*.png
blind-*.json
collision-report.md
sentences.jsonl
frames.jsonl
families.jsonl
cloze.jsonl
classcloze.jsonl
transform.jsonl
policy.json
ambig.json
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Cloudflare worker: local state and secrets. The repo is public (SPEC 19).
worker/.wrangler/
worker/.dev.vars
worker/node_modules/
.dev.vars

# Local helpers and scratch
deploy.bat
deploy-worker.bat
_gitscratch/

# OS / editor cruft
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
.DS_Store
Desktop.ini
*.tmp
*~
node_modules/
